
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mandela Digital</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #080d25;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header {
      padding: 25px;
      color: #d4af37;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    main {
      padding: 90px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    p {
      color: #c5c9d8;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    button {
      background: #d4af37;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>MANDELA DIGITAL</header>

  <main>
    <h1>Bienvenue dans notre univers.</h1>
    <p>
      Nous construisons des solutions numériques
      pour donner vie aux idées.
    </p>
    <button>Découvrir nos projets</button>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
